---
description: Decime UY MVP development rules
globs:
  - "**/*"
---

Read docs/product_brief.md and docs/development_brief.md before coding.

Build only MVP features unless explicitly asked. Prefer small, testable changes.

Use typed schemas and structured LLM outputs. Keep AI providers replaceable.

Do not auto-add training items without user approval.

For learning items, surface_text is the primary memorized form; lemma is metadata.

Keep Uruguay/Montevideo as the only active target locale in MVP.

Avoid full expression extraction in MVP.

After each coding step, provide validation commands and expected results.

Before context window ends (or after meaningful work): update docs/project_state.md and docs/mvp_tasks.md if needed. Optionally append local-only docs/conversation_log.md (gitignored).

New session: read docs/project_state.md first.
